{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/22804dfcafa9188d29fc311e23254f46.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for chaotic, couch-multiplayer mayhem! Pilot wacky, battle-hardened space ships, each with their own wild abilities, and fight for glory in explosive arena combat. It\u2019s time to brawl\u2014who will rule the arena?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/6641a8593a63cce5d7f8e6b3cdec89e4.poster.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/6641a8593a63cce5d7f8e6b3cdec89e4.webm?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/6641a8593a63cce5d7f8e6b3cdec89e4.mp4?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/7acf42f906a1a244ab82e5c7a9c1287b.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a lineup of 7 unique  brawlers, each with their own look, personality, and special powers. Whether you\u2019re zipping around as Doc Croc or befuddle enemies with the tricky Brain Gang CEO, every ship brings a new way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/0bff635f599e263674fd4c4a0e25160e.poster.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/0bff635f599e263674fd4c4a0e25160e.webm?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/0bff635f599e263674fd4c4a0e25160e.mp4?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/d32f1e1387e67bfe17c3a17c3ea27d25.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From asteroid belts to junkyard warzones, no two arenas are the same! Dodge hazards, master the terrain, and use the environment to your advantage as you battle for domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/1079a857ecb7da5ab2e5b2d771177368.poster.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/1079a857ecb7da5ab2e5b2d771177368.webm?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/1079a857ecb7da5ab2e5b2d771177368.mp4?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/92e3109d0e18435f891b2cebe48ee032.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=75 /></span>Mix things up with various action-packed game modes! Whether you're brawling for survival in random death match, assisting in team battles, or battling in crazy custom matches, there's always a new way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/1dfce60948a50d6f2130c479e50798a1.poster.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/1dfce60948a50d6f2130c479e50798a1.webm?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/1dfce60948a50d6f2130c479e50798a1.mp4?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/2205b1c406eb18607ebeb256e6273878.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and jump into fast-paced local multiplayer! Play side by side, pull off crazy stunts, and send your rivals crashing into the abyss. No online lag\u2014just pure, old-school brawling fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/f883628910eeb73acefcc21dd9cd4175.poster.avif?t=1750377682\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/f883628910eeb73acefcc21dd9cd4175.webm?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/extras/f883628910eeb73acefcc21dd9cd4175.mp4?t=1750377682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3446800?t=1750377682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446800/page_bg_raw.